Hello <%= @application.seeker.name %>,

Your application for <%= @listing.title %> was <%= @status %>.

<% case @status %>
<% when "shortlisted" %>
The host is interested. Check your application for proposed visits.
<% when "accepted" %>
The host chose you for this room. The listing is now reserved.
<% when "rejected" %>
The host is not continuing with your application. You can keep exploring other rooms on Roomies.
<% end %>

View your application:
<%= application_url(@application) %>
